{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "MyScoutee internal job audience",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Typed reads delegate to the canonical platform JobGroupScopeService. Private worker scope explicitly distinguishes inactive context from the active Dating null group. Existing JobGroupContext restores nested scope after each call and failure. Shared WorkspaceScope predicate is memoized once per job and mode by the client, avoiding per-row HTTP requests. Group buckets represent nullable Dating keys explicitly instead of lossy JSON map keys. REAL/DEMO and service capability required. Maximum body 1 MiB, user batch 4096 entries, response 2 MiB; 512 characters per identifier. Owner failures never become unrestricted scope."
  },
